                <pb facs="0485" n="451" xml:id="pg451"/>

                <head>202. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On May 16, Ambassador McClintock and Cambodian Prime Minister Leng Ngeth signed a
                    bilateral agreement on military assistance on behalf of their respective
                    countries. For text, see TIAS 3240 or 6 UST 995. Documentation on the extensive
                    and largely technical negotiations for the agreement is in Department of State,
                    Central File 751H.5–MSP.</p>
            </div>
